<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Wesfarmers to develop coal project.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Wesfarmers to develop coal project.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wesfarmers Ltd said on Monday it plans to proceed with the development of the Bengalla coal joint venture open cut mine in the Hunter Valley of New South Wales.</p>
</text>
